## §0 Terminal goal — 7-mission space telescope substrate + n=6 hardware audit

hexa-scope 도착지 = **JWST 18-segment hexagonal mirror = n=6 invariant 직접 hardware instance Bayesian audit posterior ≥ 0.9 + 7-mission overview 모두 working spec + 1+ mission data ingest .hexa wired**.

DoD:
1. `observatory` + `obs_astronomy` 2-verb working .hexa.
2. JWST 18-hexagon ↔ n=6 invariant Bayesian audit posterior ≥ 0.9.
3. 7-mission overview (Hubble · JWST · LSST · Roman · LUVOIR · Origins · HabEx) 모두 1-page deeper spec.
4. MAST archive / Vizier query .hexa wired (1+ mission).

## §A.1 Invariant lattice (n=6)

```
σ(6) · φ(6) = n · τ(6) = J₂ = 24
   12   ·   2  =  6  ·   4  = 24
```

| Symbol | Value | Role | Telescope projection |
|--------|-------|------|----------------------|
| σ(6)   | 12    | sigma — cardinality bin | 12 spectral bands (UV / Optical / IR sub-bands) |
| τ(6)   | 4     | tau — state quartet | 4 mission lifecycle phases (commission / survey / archive / decom) |
| φ(6)   | 2     | phi — verdict bit | space-based / ground-based |
| J₂     | 24    | Mathieu / Leech | JWST 18-hexagon = 3·σ/2 = J₂·3/4 segments |

**Direct hardware instance**: JWST 의 18-segment hexagonal primary mirror — `18 = 3 · σ(6)/2`. n=6 invariant 의 가장 직접적인 측정 가능 instance.

